  "notes": "Use Net as the effective amount (after PayPal fee). Store Gross and Fee in raw_data. Use Balance Impact column for direction (Credit=in, Debit=out) — more reliable than Net sign. Skip ALL rows where Status != Completed. Skip hold/reversal pairs (T1501 / T1105 event codes) — these are authorization holds that resolve same day. Transaction ID column is the external_id. Name is counterparty. Item Title is product/description when available."
